{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25823","headline":"新楼诗二十首 橘园 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 橘园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江城雾歛轻霜早，园橘千株欲变金。\n朱实摘时天路近，素英飘处海云深。\n惧同枳棘愁迁徙，每抱馨香委照临。\n怜尔结根能自保，不随寒暑换贞心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}